# OwnLane

UK operating platform for independent driving instructors.

## Stack

- `apps/api` — Yii2 REST API (PHP 8.2+)
- `apps/web` — Nuxt instructor app (Vue 3 + TypeScript)
- PostgreSQL 16 via Docker Compose

## Prerequisites

- Docker (Docker Desktop, or Colima: `colima start`)
- PHP 8.2+ with `pdo_pgsql`
- Composer
- Node.js 20+ and npm

## First-time setup

```bash
# 1. Database
docker compose up -d

# 2. API env (already present if you cloned with examples applied)
cp apps/api/.env.example apps/api/.env

# 3. Web env
cp apps/web/.env.example apps/web/.env

# 4. Install dependencies (if needed)
cd apps/api && composer install
cd ../web && npm install
```

## Run locally

Use three terminals from the repo root:

```bash
# Terminal 1 — Postgres
docker compose up -d

# Terminal 2 — API on :8080
cd apps/api
php -S 127.0.0.1:8080 -t web web/router.php

# Terminal 3 — Instructor app on :3000
cd apps/web
npm run dev
```

Open [http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000).

Health check: [http://localhost:8080/health](http://localhost:8080/health)  
Proxied from the web app: [http://localhost:3000/api/health](http://localhost:3000/api/health)

## Current milestone

Step 1 only: repo + runtimes + empty instructor shell.  
Auth, organisations, pupils and lessons are not built yet.
